  "readmeFile": "readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.1-preview.15\n- The web integration packages (FireForNet.Firebase.Messaging.Browser and FireForNet.Firebase.Messaging.Blazor) now honor their ServiceWorkerPath and ServiceWorkerScope options when registering the service worker, so consuming apps can reference the shipped service worker directly instead of vendoring a copy.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.14\n- Added web integration packages (FireForNet.Firebase.Messaging.Browser and FireForNet.Firebase.Messaging.Blazor) that implement the platform contracts for FID-based registration, message delivery, and permission management on the web.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.13\n- Initial release of the Firebase Messaging core package.\n- FID-based FCM registration (RegisterAsync/UnregisterAsync/OnRegistered/OnUnregistered).\n- Message delivery events (OnMessageReceived/OnNotificationOpened) and one-shot GetInitialMessageAsync.\n- Notification permission management (GetPermissionStatusAsync/RequestPermissionAsync).\n- Topic subscription (SubscribeToTopicAsync/UnsubscribeFromTopicAsync).\n- Contract-driven platform contracts (IMessagingRegistrar, IMessagingEventSource, IMessagingPermissionManager, IMessagingTopicSubscriber).",
